{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0182","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000039:text","row":28592,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「ハロー、ミス　イノセンス」","en":"“Hello, Miss Innocence.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011913","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"HAROO, MISU INOSENSU.\" (Hello, Miss Innocence)","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:0000006d:text","row":28593,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"全身が強ばる。","en":"Her whole body went rigid.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011914","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00002","en":"Her entire body stiffens.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000093:text","row":28594,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"緊張感が背中を覆ったのだ。","en":"Tension spread across her back.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011915","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00003","en":"A feeling of tension covers her back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000000c5:text","row":28595,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆっくりと振り向く。","en":"Slowly, she turned.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011916","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00004","en":"Slowly she turns to face.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000001c2:text","row":28596,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"ゆるやかな動作のさなか、少女はかろうじて攻撃態勢を整えた。","en":"Even within that measured motion, the girl barely managed to ready herself to strike.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011917","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00005","en":"In the course of slow slack motions, the girl just barely managed to complete her preparations for an attack.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000214:text","row":28597,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"振り返れば、厳めしい面差し。","en":"When she faced me, her expression was forbidding.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011918","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00006","en":"What looks back at me are unsparing features.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000250:text","row":28598,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「おはよう」","en":"“Good morning.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011919","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00007","en":"Taichi: \"Morning.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000297:text","row":28599,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……何の用です？」","en":"“...What do you want?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011920","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00008","en":"Kiri: \"...what is your business?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000002c3:text","row":28600,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"声が張っていた。","en":"Her voice was taut.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011921","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00009","en":"Her voice was strained,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000002eb:text","row":28601,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"可能な限り低くされた声色。","en":"She’d pitched it as low as she could.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011922","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00010","en":"the tone lowered as far as the limits of the possible.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:00000325:text","row":28602,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「用ってことはないけど―――」","en":"“Nothing in particular, but—”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011923","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00011","en":"Taichi: \"I don't really have business but---\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:0000037e:text","row":28603,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「でしたら」","en":"“In that case—”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011924","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00012","en":"Kiri: \"Well then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000003a2:text","row":28604,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"言葉を切断して霧は言う。","en":"Kiri cut me off.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011925","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00013","en":"So said Kiri cutting off my words.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0182:000003f5:text","row":28605,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうぞ、お引き取りを」","en":"“Please leave.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:011926","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0013b:00014","en":"Kiri: \"Feel free to take your leave.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
